    },
    "body": "The existing energy surrogate sends training credit through action scores plus a factual query carry, which does not reproduce the normalized query tangent of an exact source-pass categorical map. Add a separate immutable, artifact-authenticated adapter that trains through the compiled geometric relation’s two conditional push-forwards while keeping the native hard forward unchanged.\n\nExpected digest, typed binding and exact zero/unit-marker validation reject ordinary energy artifacts. Many-to-one accumulation preserves lane identity. The existing energy method and all active fits are unchanged. This component does not claim improved prediction.\n\nValidation at f9c38181619e2ee177420e298220b7af56341286: touched-file formatting and release CUDA-feature library check PASS; CPU subset 8 PASS, 0 FAIL, 1 explicitly ignored GPU test. The first broader command selected an existing unconditional CUDA test with CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES empty and failed CUDA_ERROR_NO_DEVICE; receipt retained, CPU subset rerun excludes that GPU-only test. New CPU controls cover authentication, analytic adjoints/lane isolation, source-pass/constant-action tangent controls and all 14,400 factual frames. Independent exact-draft adversarial review found no blocker. CUDA parity NOT_RUN pending the leased GPU. References #820.\n",
